<!-- ============================================================
  PRODUCT FAQ SECTION
============================================================ -->
<section class="prd-faq-section">
  <div class="prd-faq-inner">
    <div class="prd-faq-left">
      <div class="prd-faq-label">— /// KNOWLEDGE BASE</div>
      <h2 class="prd-faq-title">GOT<br/><span class="outline-text">QUESTIONS?</span></h2>
      <p class="prd-faq-sub">Everything you need to know before you order. Can't find your answer? <a href="/pages/contact" style="color:var(--accent); text-decoration:none;">Contact us →</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="prd-faq-list">
      <div class="prd-faq-item" onclick="this.classList.toggle('open')">
        <div class="prd-faq-q">Is this product genuine and good quality? <span class="prd-faq-icon">+</span></div>
        <div class="prd-faq-a">Yes — every product on DAILY/SCROLL is personally reviewed and hand-picked by our team. If it doesn't meet our standard, it simply doesn't make the cut. We stand behind every item we sell.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="prd-faq-item" onclick="this.classList.toggle('open')">
        <div class="prd-faq-q">How long does shipping take? <span class="prd-faq-icon">+</span></div>
        <div class="prd-faq-a">We offer FREE worldwide shipping on all orders. Delivery typically takes 5–14 business days depending on your location. Once shipped, you will receive a tracking number by email so you can follow your order every step of the way.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="prd-faq-item" onclick="this.classList.toggle('open')">
        <div class="prd-faq-q">What if I'm not happy with my order? <span class="prd-faq-icon">+</span></div>
        <div class="prd-faq-a">Simple - we are obsessed with the premium quality of every object we ship. We offer a strict 4-day return policy. If you receive a defective or damaged item, contact us within 4 days of delivery and we will make it right.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="prd-faq-item" onclick="this.classList.toggle('open')">
        <div class="prd-faq-q">Is it safe to pay on your store? <span class="prd-faq-icon">+</span></div>
        <div class="prd-faq-a">Absolutely. Our store is powered by Shopify — the world's most trusted e-commerce platform. All payments are processed through bank-grade SSL encryption. We accept Visa, Mastercard, Amex, PayPal, and Apple Pay. Your data is never stored or shared.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="prd-faq-item" onclick="this.classList.toggle('open')">
        <div class="prd-faq-q">You are a new store — can I trust you? <span class="prd-faq-icon">+</span></div>
        <div class="prd-faq-a">We appreciate you asking honestly. Yes - we are new and proud of it. We are a small, passionate curation team with everything to prove. That is exactly why we focus heavily on premium quality control, free shipping, and personal customer support. We earn your trust one order at a time.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="prd-faq-item" onclick="this.classList.toggle('open')">
        <div class="prd-faq-q">How do I contact support? <span class="prd-faq-icon">+</span></div>
        <div class="prd-faq-a">You can reach us via our <a href="/pages/contact" style="color:var(--accent);">Contact page</a>. We respond within 24 hours — real people, real answers. No bots.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

